ests/common/mod.rs:209:5:\noutput mismatch for driver(0) buffered==unbuffered [C]\n   C: len=1 \"\\n\"\nRust: len=0 \"\"\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\n\n\nfailures:\n    c22_buffering_pipe_vs_file\n\ntest result: FAILED. 20 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.17s\n\nerror: test failed, to rerun pass `--test phase_b_configs`","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
